# Verilog Task 1 — Sumerix Global Internship

A collection of Verilog HDL design and simulation exercises completed as part of **Task 1 of the Sumerix Global Internship**.

The repository demonstrates fundamental digital design concepts using **Verilog HDL**, along with testbenches, simulation outputs, waveform files, and verification screenshots.

## Overview

This task focuses on developing practical skills in:

* Verilog HDL
* Digital logic design
* Combinational circuit modeling
* Arithmetic circuit design
* Multiplexer implementation
* Ripple-carry addition
* Testbench development
* Functional simulation
* Waveform analysis
* Linux command-line workflow
* Organizing HDL source and simulation files

The repository follows a simple **source → testbench → simulation → verification** workflow.

