## Tools Used

| Tool               | Purpose                                         |
| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |
| **Verilog HDL**    | Hardware description and RTL design             |
| **Icarus Verilog** | Verilog compilation and simulation              |
| **GTKWave**        | Waveform visualization                          |
| **Ubuntu/Linux**   | Command-line development environment            |
| **Git**            | Version control                                 |
| **GitHub**         | Repository management and project documentation |

